			<div class="content" id="post-content-4852166">
									

<p>Seeking Greenlights:** Yes.</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Genre: Horror/Comedy</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A teenager name &quot;Janual Grey&quot; discovers that he's no longer a human after an unexplained blackout due to the seal implanted by his father has worn off while camping at Acadia National Park, and later on woke up and found himself as a reality-altering eldritch abomination.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Discovering his powers has made a few changes in him. Janual has space-time and reality-altering abilities. Every 24 hours. If Janual doesn't consume any food, he will get driven into a state of absolute hostility, where he would go on a never-ending frenzy to satisfy his hunger, which of course that time he would begin to use more of his anomalous properties to lure humans deep into the woods. This is why he usually lures bad peoples into his territory and consumes them; this is a nature he embodies.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>Central Narrative:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Ever since being held in Foundation custody after they've received reports of peoples went missing, the Foundation brought upon him several painful experiments to determine his anomalous boundaries, at the same time learning he has a relationship with SCP-105 as being her school friend, and the hungry nature that happened every 24 hours which after an incident has occurred. The Foundation learns how dangerous Janual was. They must note an essential thing, always provide food for him whenever he forgets that he must eat.</p>
<p>The shocking truth was:</p>
<p>His father is an eldritch abomination named &quot;Darkness&quot; and is worshiped by a cult named &quot;Allies of &quot;Darkness&quot; as they have succeeded in one day summoned it into their reality and offered a sacrifice as a deadman's body. Janual's father seduced his mother into having a baby while visiting the church. When Janual was born, his father implanted a seal to prevent him from exposing his powers. It wants Janual to dominate the world to prove that he's capable of becoming the next &quot;Darkness&quot;, this was explained when the cult attempted to break in to free him by using the powers granted by his father and explain to him.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The idea of having a humanoid who turned to be the son of an outer-god. I've seen many eldritch horrors inside of the SCP universe, but none of them ever comes with human natures and kindness at all.
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Draft almost finished.</p>

